{"id":"gastric-ca","cards":[{"id":"gastrief156a85","l":2,"f":"MALToma with evidence of H. pylori","b":"treatment <b>antibiotics</b> (H. pylori eradication — low-grade gastric MALT lymphoma regresses after eradication)","c":"Risk Factors"},{"id":"gastri8a67a127","l":2,"f":"Organism that carries the risk of upper GI neoplastic disease","b":"<b>Helicobacter pylori</b> (commonest cause of peptic ulcer and gastric adenocarcinoma worldwide)","c":"Risk Factors › Risk Factors"},{"id":"gastric2e43f84","l":1,"f":"<b>Lynch syndrome</b> — Mechanism?","b":"DNA mismatch-repair pathway abnormality","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastri44ad8adf","l":1,"f":"<b>Lynch syndrome</b> — Association?","b":"Colorectal, endometrial &amp; <b>intestinal-type</b> gastric cancer","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastric998026d","l":1,"f":"<b>Syndrome FAP</b> — Mechanism?","b":"APC pathway","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastrid1f34fab","l":1,"f":"<b>Syndrome FAP</b> — Association?","b":"Can also predispose to gastric cancer","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastrif369dfd7","l":1,"f":"<b>HDGC (CDH1)</b> — Mechanism?","b":"E-cadherin loss of function","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastri51e28894","l":1,"f":"<b>HDGC (CDH1)</b> — Association?","b":"<b>Diffuse-type</b> gastric cancer + lobular breast cancer","c":"Hereditary Diffuse Gastric Cancer"},{"id":"gastri225e12c4","l":1,"f":"<b>Intestinal type</b> — Key Association?","b":"Associated with Lynch syndrome","c":"Linitis Plastica › Classification"},{"id":"gastrib97ae0bb","l":1,"f":"<b>Diffuse type</b> — Key Association?","b":"Associated with HDGC / CDH1 mutation","c":"Linitis Plastica › Classification"},{"id":"gastrie1a5aa8c","l":1,"f":"<b>Mixed type</b> — Key Association?","b":"Features of both","c":"Linitis Plastica › Classification"},{"id":"gastriaa1203b1","l":1,"f":"<b>Borrmann Classification</b> — Key Association?","b":"<i>More advanced molecular/genetic classifi