46","l":1,"f":"<b>M</b> — Stage IVB?","b":"M1","c":"Diagnostic Laparoscopy"},{"id":"gastria1996b4a","l":1,"f":"<b>Tis / T1a (very early, &lt;2 cm, no metastasis)</b> — Approach?","b":"May be amenable to <b>endoscopic resection</b>","c":"Treatment › Treatment"},{"id":"gastri08dc99c4","l":1,"f":"<b>Stage T1b</b> — Approach?","b":"Generally requires <b>surgical resection</b> rather than endoscopic treatment","c":"Treatment › Treatment"},{"id":"gastri973a17ea","l":1,"f":"<b>T2 or higher</b> — Approach?","b":"<b>Neoadjuvant chemotherapy → surgery → adjuvant chemotherapy</b>","c":"Treatment › Treatment"},{"id":"gastri91ecaa65","l":1,"f":"<b>Proximal tumor</b> — Procedure?","b":"<b>Total gastrectomy</b>","c":"Regional Lymphatics › Surgery"},{"id":"gastri6fbf5c42","l":1,"f":"<b>Distal tumor</b> — Procedure?","b":"<b>Subtotal / distal gastrectomy</b>","c":"Regional Lymphatics › Surgery"},{"id":"gastri017605ea","l":1,"f":"<b>cTis or cT1a</b> — Patient?","b":"→ Non-surgical candidate","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastri1426781b","l":1,"f":"<b>cTis or cT1a</b> — Primary treatment?","b":"→ ER","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastrif1d5a5a2","l":1,"f":"<b>cTis or cT1a</b> — Next?","b":"→ Endoscopic surveillance","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastribdfe9d84","l":1,"f":"<b>Locoregional disease (cM0)</b> — Patient?","b":"→ Medically fit, potentially resectable → cT1b","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastria3b72c4f","l":1,"f":"<b>Locoregional disease (cM0)</b> — Primary treatment?","b":"→ Surgery","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastrifc0cea24","l":1,"f":"<b>Locoregional disease (cM0)</b> — Next?","b":"→ Surgical Outcomes for Patients Who Have Not Received Preoperative Therapy (see GAST-4)","c":"Treatment"},{"id":"gastri7f2ace73","l":2,"f":"Antral adenocarcinoma consented for surgery — the low blood level that suggests nutritional deficiency","b":"<b>albumin</b>","c":"The INT-0116 Trial (Macdonald Trial)"},{"id":"gastri0b92a372","l":1,"f":"<b>Resectable disease</b> — Treatment?","b":"→ Surgery (preferred) or Palliativ